flowchart TD
  A["Diversity case: does state or federal law govern the issue?"] --> B["Is a federal statute or Federal Rule broad enough<br/>to control the issue? (Stewart; Hanna; Shady Grove)"]
  B -- "Yes: statute" --> C["Is the statute constitutional,<br/>i.e., at least arguably procedural?"]
  C -- Yes --> D("Apply the federal statute<br/>(Stewart)")
  B -- "Yes: Rule" --> E["Does the Rule really regulate procedure?<br/>28 U.S.C. § 2072 (Hanna; Shady Grove)"]
  E -- Yes --> F("Apply the Federal Rule<br/>(Hanna; Shady Grove)")
  B -- "No: judge-made practice" --> G["Would ignoring state law frustrate the twin aims:<br/>discouraging forum shopping and avoiding<br/>inequitable administration of the laws? (York; Hanna)"]
  G -- No --> H("Apply federal practice")
  G -- Yes --> I["Is there a strong countervailing federal interest,<br/>such as the role of the jury? (Byrd)"]
  I -- Yes --> H
  I -- No --> J("Apply state law, accommodating<br/>federal interests where possible (Gasperini)")
